        "created_at": "2021-04-06T11:32:40.029Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"JoeSteeloak\" data-post=\"474\" data-topic=\"6706\" data-full=\"true\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/joesteeloak/48/4853_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> JoeSteeloak:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Well there is a page with all of them gathered on the same page, but I have trouble finding it easily.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah, the wiki’s structure in general needs a serious overhaul. Me, Lynkfox, and WalkingTarget have been discussing it off and on.</p>\n<p>Edit: Oh right, I forgot Lynkfox was silly and thought it was a good idea to give me admin powers, so I flexed and edited the sidebar to add/remove a few things. Mostly adding Adam’s various art things like the Covers and Inktober galleries.</p>",
