        "id": 243188,
        "name": "Chaosmancer",
        "username": "Chaosmancer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/{size}/1977_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-03-06T04:48:06.716Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, it looks like there are maybe some people still working on the Sentinels Wiki. One thing the wiki had that I always thought was useful and cool was a card list.</p>\n<p>Well, I’ve been making a card list for my own use in Play-by-Post games, and I was wondering if anyone was interested in getting a link to it if they were planning on adding the DE cards to the Wiki in some way.</p>\n<p>I did not include Character cards or the Villain set-up card. I also did not include any flavor text, or issue numbers. But, I figured if anyone was going to tackle that sort of update project, this could be a massive time-saver to just copy what I already was doing for a separate purpose.</p>\n<p>I thought about posting it here directly, but I wasn’t sure if that would upset people, so just hit me up in DMs or PMs or whatever we call them on this site, and I can forward you the Link.</p>\n<p>Thank you for all you guys do keeping this thing going, and I hope you are all doing well.</p>",
