        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-03-06T12:47:54.325Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have a copy of WalkingTarget’s own database for his card lookup bot, but because the update to the wiki software broke our existing templates they have to be rewritten before we can actually properly add anything to them, and I’ve been dealing with a bunch of health issues making it difficult to work on such things at more than a snail’s pace.</p>\n<p>I’m going to try to kludge something together for DE as a stopgap. In the mean time, WT’s said he’s put his bot on the RoD Discord server (it’s also already on the LP server).</p>\n<p>I really wish we had followed my suggested procedure of updating a test wiki setup and only migrating the updates over once we had everything up and running properly, but instead Lynkfox updated the live wiki, so here we are.</p>",
        "post_number": 480,
        "post_type": 1,
