        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/{size}/1977_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-03-06T15:17:03.599Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey, I’m not complaining. You guys do amazing work, I just wasn’t sure who was active or if there was a plan.</p>\n<p>If you have health issues, focus on those. Way more important than this. I was just offering a “hey, I’ve written all this stuff, is this something that will save you guys time and effort”</p>\n<p>If it would be helpful to you guys, I could try and do something. But I also work at a snail’s pace, have a dozen other projects, and just pushed myself to get this excel sheet library finished. But the offer of giving you guys what I got, so that when you get to the stage of typing them all you just have to copy and paste what I wrote, maybe a few edits for formatting purposes, is still on the table.</p>",
