        "created_at": "2022-03-06T15:32:49.025Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sorry, I didn’t mean that to sound like a castigation, more just an explanation. (Well, OK, I’m still a little salty at the wiki update bit,  but not at what you said.)</p>\n<p>We already have all the information from the cards themselves, as WT typed it all up for his bot, it’s just a matter of my getting it proofread and then the wikicode… coded.</p>\n<p>Well, and also I wanted to promote that WT programmed a really cool card lookup bot for the Discords. It also looks up the various comic issues as well.</p>",
