        "created_at": "2022-03-06T15:38:58.460Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Naw, it’s fine. I just wanted to make sure there wasn’t any miscommunication. I can’t help with coding unfortunately, it is a skill I distinctly lack.</p>\n<p>Good luck to you, and again, your health is more important than the database for a card game. So don’t work too hard or worry too much over it.</p>",
